landscape 平滑（3-seed exception_only variance=0），\n      因此即使在 noisy intermediate length 上也能稳定学到部分模式。但 384 tokens 不足以\n      覆盖多数 fail 样本的完整 exception trace（exception 通常在 trace 最后 200-500 tokens），\n      导致 ~50% 的 fail 样本 exception 信息被截断。结果: gradual rise，interpolating between\n      256 and 512，约 84.7%。这使 Qwen-7B 成为 \"gradual transition\" 模式的代表——\n      与 Qwen-1.5B 的 sharp transition 形成对比，破坏 universal pattern 叙事。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Qwen-7B budget curve (updated)\"\n        data:\n          - {length: \"tail-256\", accuracy: \"77.48%\", delta_vs_prev: \"—\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-384\", accuracy: \"84.7%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+7.2pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-512\", accuracy: \"93.6%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+8.9pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-1024\", accuracy: \"96.5%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+2.9pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-2048\", accuracy: \"97.3%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+0.8pp\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Qwen-7B curve 呈现平滑 S-shape，拐点在 384-512 之间。transition 是 gradual 而非 sharp——两个相邻 128-token 区间各贡献约 7-9pp。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen-7B 是 4 模型中唯一呈现 clean monotonic + gradual transition 的模型。\n      然而 \"gradual\" 意味着无法定义 discrete phase transition point，削弱\n      \"sharp phase transition\" claim。如果其他模型也 gradual 则可声称 universal\n      gradual pattern；但其他模型模式不同，Qwen-7B 的 gradual 反而成为 model-specific\n      behavior 的证据。\n\n  - name: \"qwen15b_full_trace_tail384_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B tail-384，验证小模型 transition timing\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.745\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.720\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.769\n      majority_baseline: 0.7151\n      lift_over_majority: 0.030\n      pass_precision: 0.835\n      pass_recall: 0.810\n      pass_f1: 0.822\n      fail_precision: 0.545\n      fail_recall: 0.590\n      fail_f1: 0.567\n      n_test: 1190\n      train_loss: 0.25\n      eval_loss: 0.56\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen-1.5B tail-256=72.6%, tail-512=95.6%。这个模型在 exception_only 上\n      与 7B 完全一致（99.83%），但在 noisy full_trace 上更脆弱（head-2048 仅 75.3%\n      vs 7B 的 81.6%）。1.5B 模型容量有限，需要更完整的 diagnostic signal 才能\n      学到有用模式——384 tokens 提供的 partial information 对它来说 insufficient，\n      无法从噪声中提取信号。结果: 仅比 tail-256 提升 ~2pp，仍接近 baseline。\n      真正的 phase transition 发生在 384→512 之间（+21pp 的巨大跳跃），显示\n      512 tokens 是该模型的 critical threshold——刚好覆盖大多数 fail 样本的完整\n      exception + assertion 信息。这是 \"sharp transition\" 模式，但 threshold\n      位置 (384-512) 与 Qwen-7B 的 gradual zone 不同。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Qwen-1.5B budget curve (updated)\"\n        data:\n          - {length: \"tail-256\", accuracy: \"72.6%\", delta_vs_prev: \"—\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-384\", accuracy: \"74.5%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+1.9pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-512\", accuracy: \"95.6%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+21.1pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-1024\", accuracy: \"96.6%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+1.0pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-2048\", accuracy: \"97.9%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+1.3pp\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Qwen-1.5B 呈现 step function: 384→512 处有 ~21pp 的 cliff jump，之前和之后都近乎 flat。与 Qwen-7B 的 gradual curve 形成鲜明对比。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen-1.5B 的 sharp transition 说明小模型的 information utilization threshold\n      更高——384 tokens 的 partial trace 对 1.5B 几乎无用，但 512 tokens 突然\n      提供了 sufficient signal。这与 exception_only 的 scale-invariance（1.5B=7B=99.83%）\n      形成 interesting 对比：exception signal 因其 structural simplicity 对模型容量\n      无要求，但 full_trace 的 utilization threshold 是 capacity-dependent。然而\n      这一 finding 无法 universalize——同 scale/同 family 的 7B 模型呈现完全不同\n      的 gradual pattern。\n\n  - name: \"deepseek_full_trace_tail384_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B tail-384，验证 alternative architecture transition\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.883\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.863\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.902\n      majority_baseline: 0.7151\n      lift_over_majority: 0.168\n      pass_precision: 0.920\n      pass_recall: 0.915\n      pass_f1: 0.917\n      fail_precision: 0.792\n      fail_recall: 0.805\n      fail_f1: 0.798\n      n_test: 1190\n      train_loss: 0.15\n      eval_loss: 0.38\n    result_rationale: >\n      DeepSeek tail-256=76.4%, tail-512=93.9%。DeepSeek tokenizer 在 tail 区域\n      的 token density 不同于 Qwen（不同 BPE vocabulary），384 DeepSeek tokens\n      覆盖更多字符内容。加之 DeepSeek 在 full_trace 条件下对 fail 模式的学习\n      更快（tail-2048 已 95%），transition 更早发生。88.3% 说明 DeepSeek 在 384\n      tokens 时已经获得了大部分 diagnostic information——与 Qwen-7B (84.7%) 和\n      Qwen-1.5B (74.5%) 形成第三种不同模式：\"early-onset transition\"。但这也暴露了\n      DeepSeek tail-2048 (95.0%) 相对 tail-1024 (96.5%) 的轻微非单调性——\n      longer context 引入 noise。整体模式: 提前进入 transition + 后端轻微 regression。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"DeepSeek budget curve (updated)\"\n        data:\n          - {length: \"tail-256\", accuracy: \"76.4%\", delta_vs_prev: \"—\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-384\", accuracy: \"88.3%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+11.9pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-512\", accuracy: \"93.9%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+5.6pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-1024\", accuracy: \"96.5%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+2.6pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-2048\", accuracy: \"95.0%\", delta_vs_prev: \"-1.5pp\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"DeepSeek curve 左移，在 256→384 已有 +11.9pp 大幅上升，但在 tail-2048 处轻微回落（-1.5pp），呈现 inverted-U tail。\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek 的 early-onset transition 与 Qwen 两模型模式都不同。可能原因:\n      (1) tokenizer efficiency 不同导致同 token 数覆盖不同内容量；\n      (2) 预训练数据差异导致 trace 理解的 readiness 不同。\n      tail-2048 的轻微 regression 虽小（-1.5pp, 可能在 CI 内），但与 CodeLlama\n      的灾难性 regression 构成连续谱，暗示 long-context full_trace 对 SFT 有普遍\n      的 diminishing/negative returns 趋势——但程度完全 model-specific。\n\n  - name: \"codellama13b_full_trace_tail384_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct tail-384，验证 LLaMA family transition\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.735\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.711\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.760\n      majority_baseline: 0.7151\n      lift_over_majority: 0.020\n      pass_precision: 0.800\n      pass_recall: 0.845\n      pass_f1: 0.822\n      fail_precision: 0.555\n      fail_recall: 0.458\n      fail_f1: 0.502\n      n_test: 1190\n      train_loss: 0.28\n      eval_loss: 0.62\n    result_rationale: >\n      CodeLlama tail-256=77.9%, tail-512=97.5%。在 worst 档下 CodeLlama tail-384\n      出现 anomalous dip——accuracy 73.5% 低于 tail-256 (77.9%) 4.4pp。根因假说:\n      CodeLlama tokenizer 在 384-token window 内截取到 trace 中间位置的 ambiguous\n      content（包含 partial loop iterations 但 exception 被截断），形成比 tail-256\n      更具误导性的输入。tail-256 因内容极少反而让模型回退到 no_trace-like 的保守策略\n      （~78%≈no_trace+few pp），而 tail-384 提供了 \"just enough to be dangerous\"\n      的 partial information——模型看到了 execution trace 但缺少 diagnostic conclusion，\n      导致 fail_recall 大幅下降 (0.458)。这与 CodeLlama 在 tail-2048 (41.8%) 的\n      catastrophic failure 以及 tail-1024 v2 的不稳定 (87.6%) 构成系统性 pattern:\n      CodeLlama 对 intermediate-noise trace 特别脆弱。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"CodeLlama budget curve (updated)\"\n        data:\n          - {length: \"tail-256\", accuracy: \"77.9%\", delta_vs_prev: \"—\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-384\", accuracy: \"73.5%\", delta_vs_prev: \"-4.4pp ⚠️\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-512\", accuracy: \"97.5%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+24.0pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-1024\", accuracy: \"98.2%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+0.7pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-2048\", accuracy: \"41.8%\", delta_vs_prev: \"-56.4pp ⚠️\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"CodeLlama curve 呈 W-shape: 77.9→73.5→97.5→98.2→41.8。两个 anomalous dip (384, 2048)，中间有一个极窄的 peak band (512-1024)。这种 chaotic budget curve 是审稿人攻击的主要靶点。\"\n    analysis: >\n      CodeLlama 的 multi-point anomaly 使 budget curve 作为 universal contribution\n      彻底失效。任何试图 fit a universal curve 的尝试都会被 CodeLlama 的 W-shape 击碎。\n      审稿人会质疑 training pipeline 健壮性——为什么同一 codebase 对 CodeLlama\n      产生如此不稳定的结果？回应策略: (1) 诚实报告所有数据; (2) 指出 CodeLlama 的\n      LLaMA tokenizer 与 code-specific tokenizers (Qwen/DeepSeek) 的效率差异导致\n      同 token 数对应不同 content coverage; (3) 将 CodeLlama 的 instability 作为\n      \"why simplicity matters\" 的反面论据——exception_only 在 CodeLlama 上 99.83%\n      完美，不受 length budget 影响。\n\n  - name: \"plan_016_cross_model_synthesis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"tail-384 × 4 模型交叉分析: phase transition 模式分裂总结\"\n    expected_results:\n      tail384_cross_model_std_pp: 6.4\n      tail384_cross_model_range_pp: 14.8  # 88.3 - 73.5\n      phase_transition_sharpness: 0.2\n      budget_curve_consistent_models: 1\n      transition_patterns:\n        qwen7b: \"gradual_monotonic\"\n        qwen15b: \"sharp_delayed\"\n        deepseek: \"early_onset_with_tail_regression\"\n        codellama: \"non_monotonic_W_shape\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      4 模型呈现 4 种不同的 budget curve 形态。phase_transition_sharpness=0.2 因为\n      只有 Qwen-1.5B 显示真正的 sharp transition (tail-384→512 跳 21pp)，其他\n      模型要么 gradual (Qwen-7B)、要么 early-onset (DeepSeek)、要么 anomalous\n      (CodeLlama)。budget_curve_consistent_models=1 因为只有 Qwen-7B 呈现 clean\n      monotonic pattern（DeepSeek 有 tail regression, CodeLlama 有两处 anomaly,\n      Qwen-1.5B 虽 monotonic 但 step-function 形态不同于 Qwen-7B 的 gradual）。\n      Cross-model std=6.4pp 在 [5,12] 范围内。这证明 budget curve 形态是\n      model-specific 的——无法提炼 universal trace-length → accuracy pattern。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-model tail-384 comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {model: \"Qwen-7B\", tail256: \"77.5%\", tail384: \"84.7%\", tail512: \"93.6%\", delta_256_384: \"+7.2pp\", delta_384_512: \"+8.9pp\", pattern: \"gradual\"}\n          - {model: \"Qwen-1.5B\", tail256: \"72.6%\", tail384: \"74.5%\", tail512: \"95.6%\", delta_256_384: \"+1.9pp\", delta_384_512: \"+21.1pp\", pattern: \"sharp_delayed\"}\n          - {model: \"DeepSeek\", tail256: \"76.4%\", tail384: \"88.3%\", tail512: \"93.9%\", delta_256_384: \"+11.9pp\", delta_384_512: \"+5.6pp\", pattern: \"early_onset\"}\n          - {model: \"CodeLlama\", tail256: \"77.9%\", tail384: \"73.5%\", tail512: \"97.5%\", delta_256_384: \"-4.4pp\", delta_384_512: \"+24.0pp\", pattern: \"non_monotonic\"}\n      - name: \"Full budget curve matrix (all models)\"\n        data:\n          - {model: \"Qwen-7B\", t256: \"77.5\", t384: \"84.7\", t512: \"93.6\", t1024: \"96.5\", t2048: \"97.3\", monotonic: \"✓\", pattern: \"gradual S-curve\"}\n          - {model: \"Qwen-1.5B\", t256: \"72.6\", t384: \"74.5\", t512: \"95.6\", t1024: \"96.6\", t2048: \"97.9\", monotonic: \"✓\", pattern: \"step function at 512\"}\n          - {model: \"DeepSeek\", t256: \"76.4\", t384: \"88.3\", t512: \"93.9\", t1024: \"96.5\", t2048: \"95.0\", monotonic: \"✗\", pattern: \"early rise + tail regression\"}\n          - {model: \"CodeLlama\", t256: \"77.9\", t384: \"73.5\", t512: \"97.5\", t1024: \"98.2\", t2048: \"41.8\", monotonic: \"✗\", pattern: \"W-shape with 2 anomalies\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4-model budget curve overlay plot: x-axis = tail token budget (256/384/512/1024/2048), y-axis = accuracy。4 条曲线形态完全不同——Qwen-7B 平滑 S-curve, Qwen-1.5B 在 512 处有 cliff, DeepSeek 早期上升+后端轻微下降, CodeLlama 呈 W-shape。无法 fit 任何 universal trend line。exception_only 水平线 (99.83%) 在所有 budget 值上方，强调 length budget 对 exception signal 无关。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Budget curve 作为 contribution 在 worst 档下完全失效。4 模型 4 种模式，\n      无法声称 \"trace length has a universal effect on verdict accuracy\"。\n      唯一 universal 的 finding 是 exception_only (99.83%) 在所有模型上不受\n      length budget 影响——这反而强化了 \"simplicity is robustness\" 的 headline。\n      Budget curve 应移至 Appendix，仅作为 \"why exception_only is preferable\"\n      的 supporting evidence：同 token budget 下 full_trace 的效果完全不可预测，\n      而 exception_only 无此问题。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_017: Cross-seed budget curve — tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"cross_seed_budget_curve_tail512\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_017\"\n    description: \"tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds，验证 phase transition 后 convergence band robustness\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b:\n        seed42: 0.936\n        seed123: 0.924\n        seed456: 0.931\n        mean: 0.930\n        std_pp: 0.6\n        range_pp: 1.2\n      qwen15b:\n        seed42: 0.956\n        seed123: 0.908\n        seed456: 0.942\n        mean: 0.935\n        std_pp: 2.5\n        range_pp: 4.8\n      deepseek:\n        seed42: 0.939\n        seed123: 0.876\n        seed456: 0.919\n        mean: 0.911\n        std_pp: 3.2\n        range_pp: 6.3\n      codellama:\n        seed42: 0.975\n        seed123: 0.809\n        seed456: 0.943\n        mean: 0.909\n        std_pp: 8.7\n        range_pp: 16.6\n      overall_cross_model_seed_std_mean: 3.75\n    result_rationale: >\n      tail-512 是 transition 后的第一个 \"高 accuracy\" 点，但在 worst 档下 seed\n      robustness 与 signal complexity 正相关。exception_only（最简信号）seed variance\n      已知: Qwen 0pp, DeepSeek 4.8pp (σ)。full_trace tail-512 的 signal 远比\n      exception_only complex（包含 loop iterations, variable states, partial traces），\n      因此 seed sensitivity 应更严重。\n\n      Qwen-7B: LoRA landscape 平滑（exception_only 3-seed variance=0），tail-512\n      的 seed variance 也最小（σ=0.6pp）。但即使 Qwen-7B 也有 ~1pp 波动——\n      full_trace 信号的 noise 导致不同 seed 的 LoRA 从 trace 中学到略微不同的\n      patterns。\n\n      Qwen-1.5B: 容量限制放大 seed sensitivity。在 exception_only 上 scale-invariant\n      (99.83%)，但 full_trace 依赖 execution reasoning——1.5B 的 reasoning 容量\n      有限，seed123 未能充分学到 trace→verdict 映射。σ=2.5pp，moderate。\n\n      DeepSeek: 已知 LoRA initialization sensitivity（exception_only seed123=91.09%\n      vs seed42/456=99.33%）。full_trace 放大此效应。seed123 再次成为 outlier\n      (87.6%)，但 gap 不如 exception_only 的 seed123 极端——因为 full_trace 的\n      ceiling 本身较低（~94%），outlier seed 的退化空间也较小。σ=3.2pp。\n\n      CodeLlama: training instability 的系统性问题。已知 tail-1024 有 run-to-run\n      variance (87.6% vs 98.2%)，tail-2048 catastrophic。tail-512 虽然是 CodeLlama\n      的 \"sweet spot\"（single seed=97.5%），但 seed variance 极大——seed123 仅\n      80.9%，几乎 17pp 退化。根因: CodeLlama 的 LLaMA tokenizer 对 code trace\n      的 tokenization 效率低，512 tokens 覆盖内容较少，不同 seed 的 LoRA 可能\n      focus on different trace regions，导致 catastrophic divergence。σ=8.7pp\n      使 CodeLlama 的 budget curve 在 seed 维度也不 robust。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds\"\n        data:\n          - {model: \"Qwen-7B\", seed42: \"93.6%\", seed123: \"92.4%\", seed456: \"93.1%\", mean: \"93.0%\", std: \"0.6pp\", verdict: \"✓ robust\"}\n          - {model: \"Qwen-1.5B\", seed42: \"95.6%\", seed123: \"90.8%\", seed456: \"94.2%\", mean: \"93.5%\", std: \"2.5pp\", verdict: \"△ moderate\"}\n          - {model: \"DeepSeek\", seed42: \"93.9%\", seed123: \"87.6%\", seed456: \"91.9%\", mean: \"91.1%\", std: \"3.2pp\", verdict: \"△ moderate\"}\n          - {model: \"CodeLlama\", seed42: \"97.5%\", seed123: \"80.9%\", seed456: \"94.3%\", mean: \"90.9%\", std: \"8.7pp\", verdict: \"✗ unstable\"}\n      - name: \"对比: exception_only seed robustness\"\n        data:\n          - {model: \"Qwen-7B\", exc_std: \"0.00pp\", tail512_std: \"0.6pp\", ratio: \"∞\"}\n          - {model: \"Qwen-1.5B\", exc_std: \"0.00pp (单 seed)\", tail512_std: \"2.5pp\", ratio: \"—\"}\n          - {model: \"DeepSeek\", exc_std: \"4.8pp\", tail512_std: \"3.2pp\", ratio: \"0.67\"}\n          - {model: \"CodeLlama\", exc_std: \"0.10pp\", tail512_std: \"8.7pp\", ratio: \"87x\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Violin plot / box plot: 每个模型一列，3 seeds 为点。Qwen-7B 紧密聚拢，CodeLlama 大幅分散。overlaid horizontal line at exception_only accuracy (99.83%) 强调: 即使 tail-512 的 best seed (CodeLlama 97.5%) 也不及 exception_only，且 seed stability 远不如。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-seed robustness 进一步削弱 budget curve contribution。即使在 tail-512\n      这个 \"transition 后最稳定\" 的点，4 模型中只有 Qwen-7B 真正 seed-robust。\n      CodeLlama 的 σ=8.7pp 使其 single-seed 数据完全不可信——97.5% 可能只是\n      lucky seed。这意味着论文中报告的所有 single-seed budget curve 数据点都有\n      潜在的 seed noise 问题，但我们不可能为每个 length × model 组合都跑 3 seeds\n      （预算 24 GPU-hours 只够 tail-512 这一个点）。\n      \n      对论文的影响: (1) budget curve 的可信度进一步下降——不仅 model-specific，\n      还 seed-sensitive; (2) exception_only 的 seed robustness（Qwen 0pp, CodeLlama\n      0.1pp）与 full_trace tail-512 的 seed variance（CodeLlama 8.7pp）形成\n      87x 的对比，成为 \"simplicity enables robustness\" 的额外弹药; (3) 建议\n      仅在 Appendix 报告 tail-512 seed data，不 support 任何 main claim。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_018: Error analysis\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"error_analysis_cross_condition\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_018\"\n    description: \"用已有 predictions.jsonl 分析 4 条件的 failure modes\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_errors:\n        total: 2\n        all_generatorexit: true\n        sample_ids: [901, 905]\n        function: \"check_dict_case (HumanEval/95)\"\n        error_direction: \"pass→fail (false negative)\"\n        cross_seed_overlap: \"100% (3/3 seeds identical)\"\n      vota_errors:\n        total: 7\n        categories:\n          generatorexit: 2\n          long_trace_attention_dilution: 3\n          ambiguous_loop_pattern: 2\n        false_negative_rate: 0.71  # 5/7 are pass→fail\n        overlap_with_exception_only: 2  # same GeneratorExit samples\n      full_trace_errors:\n        total: 217\n        categories:\n          long_program_overload: 142\n          edge_case_subtle_bug: 38\n          correct_but_verbose_trace: 22\n          random_noise: 15\n        false_negative_rate: 0.62\n        median_trace_length_errors_vs_correct: \"2.3x longer\"\n      no_trace_errors:\n        total: 296\n        categories:\n          subtle_functional_bugs: 108\n          edge_case_only_failures: 87\n          correct_format_wrong_logic: 63\n          random: 38\n        false_negative_rate: 0.55\n        fail_recall: 0.735\n      cross_condition_overlap:\n        exc_intersect_vota: 0.286  # 2/7\n        vota_intersect_full: 0.714  # 5/7\n        full_intersect_no_trace: 0.691  # 150/217\n        exc_intersect_no_trace: 0.007  # 2/296\n    result_rationale: >\n      exception_only: 2 errors 已知且不可约（GeneratorExit），不提供新 insight。\n\n      VOTA: 7 errors 分为三类。(1) 2 个与 exception_only 重叠的 GeneratorExit——\n      inherited from Tier 1。(2) 3 个 long-trace samples 中 loop/ae tokens 稀释了\n      exception signal 的 attention——这些样本在 exception_only 下正确但 VOTA 下\n      错误，直接支持 \"Tier 2 introduces noise\" claim。(3) 2 个 ambiguous loop\n      patterns——loop 正常但有 exception，模型对 conflicting signals 做出错误判断。\n      这 7 个 error 的异质性使其无法归为单一 category。\n\n      full_trace: 217 errors 高度异质。最大类 (142/217) 是 long programs 的\n      information overload——trace 太长模型无法有效处理。38 个 edge case 中模型\n      看到了 trace 但未能正确 interpret 细微的 bug pattern。22 个 correct but\n      verbose——trace 的冗余信息误导模型预测 fail。这种高异质性使 error analysis\n      难以 yield actionable insight。\n\n      no_trace: 296 errors 中最大类是 subtle functional bugs (108)——没有 trace\n      时模型仅能依赖 code structure/style heuristics，对逻辑正确但风格 unusual 的\n      代码也会误判。fail_recall 仅 0.735 说明 ~27% 的 fail 样本被漏判。\n\n      Cross-condition overlap 低: exception_only 的 2 个 error 仅在 VOTA 的 7 个\n      error 中出现 2 个（28.6%），说明不同条件的 failure modes 几乎不重叠——\n      它们 fail on fundamentally different samples for fundamentally different reasons。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Error category distribution\"\n        data:\n          - {condition: \"exception_only\", n_errors: 2, primary_category: \"GeneratorExit (100%)\", actionable: \"No (irreducible)\"}\n          - {condition: \"VOTA\", n_errors: 7, primary_category: \"Mixed (GenExit 29% / attention dilution 43% / ambiguous loop 29%)\", actionable: \"Partial\"}\n          - {condition: \"full_trace\", n_errors: 217, primary_category: \"Long-trace overload (65%)\", actionable: \"Not without architecture change\"}\n          - {condition: \"no_trace\", n_errors: 296, primary_category: \"Subtle bugs undetectable from code alone (37%)\", actionable: \"No (inherent limitation)\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram 或 upset plot 展示 4 条件 error overlap。核心发现: overlap 极小，各条件 fail 在不同维度——但 figure 可能 too noisy for publication（296 vs 7 vs 2 的 scale 差异使 Venn 不 informative）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Error analysis 在 worst 档下产出有限。exception_only 的 2 个 error 已在\n      irreducible error analysis (D5) 中完全解析——无新 finding。VOTA 的 7 个 error\n      异质但数量太少不支撑 statistical analysis。full_trace 的 217 个 error 有\n      pattern（long traces dominant）但这是 Claim 2 已覆盖的 information overload\n      finding 的 restatement。no_trace 的 296 个 error 说明 baseline 弱但无新 insight。\n      \n      Cross-condition overlap 低本身是 interesting finding（不同 representations\n      fail on orthogonal dimensions），但在 worst 档下这无法 crystallize into a\n      clean narrative。建议: 仅在 Appendix 放 error breakdown table，Discussion\n      简短提及 orthogonal failure modes 现象。不值得作为独立 contribution。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_019: Cross-model calibration for exception_only\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"cross_model_calibration_exception_only\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_019\"\n    description: \"4 模型 × exception_only 的 ECE/Brier 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b:\n        ece: 0.0027\n        brier: 0.0013\n        mce: 0.835\n        accuracy: 0.9983\n      qwen15b:\n        ece: 0.0041\n        brier: 0.0019\n        mce: 0.72\n        accuracy: 0.9983\n      deepseek:\n        ece: 0.0523\n        brier: 0.0318\n        mce: 0.89\n        accuracy: 0.9933\n      codellama:\n        ece: 0.0183\n        brier: 0.0072\n        mce: 0.78\n        accuracy: 0.9983\n      cross_model_ece_std: 0.0225\n      cross_model_ece_range: 0.0496\n      universal_calibration: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen-7B ECE=0.0027 已知（近完美）。\n\n      Qwen-1.5B: exception_only accuracy 与 7B 完全相同 (99.83%)，但 1.5B 的\n      logit 分布可能略 less peaked（smaller model capacity → slightly more\n      uncertain probability outputs）。预测 ECE=0.0041，仍然 excellent。\n\n      DeepSeek: 这是 worst 档的关键分歧点。DeepSeek exception_only seed42=99.33%\n      （epoch3），但 epoch1=99.83%→epoch3=99.33% 的退化暗示 training 过程中\n      calibration 恶化。DeepSeek 的 LoRA 训练不稳定（seed123=91.09%）说明模型\n      的 probability landscape rugged。即使在 seed42 这个 \"好\" seed 上，model\n      的 predicted probabilities 可能 systematically miscalibrated——对 pass 样本\n      过度自信（many samples near 1.0 probability）但对 fail 样本 underconfident\n      （several samples in 0.3-0.6 range instead of near 0.0），导致 ECE=0.0523。\n      这不是灾难性的 miscalibration，但与 Qwen 的 0.0027 相差 ~19x，破坏了\n      \"universal near-perfect calibration\" 的叙事。Brier=0.0318 也偏高——\n      主要来自 8 个 error samples 的 high predicted pass probability。\n\n      CodeLlama: accuracy=99.83%（与 Qwen 相同），但 CodeLlama 的 LLaMA 架构\n      在 code domain 的 confidence distribution 不同。ECE=0.0183 处于中等水平——\n      优于 DeepSeek 但 ~7x worse than Qwen。可能原因: CodeLlama 虽然 accuracy\n      完美，但对少数 borderline samples 的 probability assignment 不够 extreme\n      （predicts 0.85 instead of 0.99 for clear pass cases）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-model calibration for exception_only\"\n        data:\n          - {model: \"Qwen-7B\", accuracy: \"99.83%\", ece: 0.0027, brier: 0.0013, calibration_quality: \"Near-perfect\"}\n          - {model: \"Qwen-1.5B\", accuracy: \"99.83%\", ece: 0.0041, brier: 0.0019, calibration_quality: \"Excellent\"}\n          - {model: \"DeepSeek\", accuracy: \"99.33%\", ece: 0.0523, brier: 0.0318, calibration_quality: \"Moderate\"}\n          - {model: \"CodeLlama\", accuracy: \"99.83%\", ece: 0.0183, brier: 0.0072, calibration_quality: \"Good\"}\n      - name: \"Calibration gap: exception_only vs no_trace (cross-model)\"\n        data:\n          - {model: \"Qwen-7B\", exc_ece: 0.0027, no_trace_ece: 0.1715, ratio: \"63x\"}\n          - {model: \"Qwen-1.5B\", exc_ece: 0.0041, no_trace_ece: \"~0.21\", ratio: \"~51x\"}\n          - {model: \"DeepSeek\", exc_ece: 0.0523, no_trace_ece: \"~0.18\", ratio: \"~3.4x\"}\n          - {model: \"CodeLlama\", exc_ece: 0.0183, no_trace_ece: \"~0.17\", ratio: \"~9.3x\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Reliability diagram grid (2×2): 4 models, exception_only condition。Qwen 两模型几乎完美对角线，CodeLlama 略有偏离，DeepSeek 在 low-confidence bins 有明显 miscalibration。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-model calibration 在 worst 档下呈现 model-dependency。Qwen family\n      (7B + 1.5B) 近完美，但 DeepSeek ECE 比 Qwen 高 ~19x（0.0523 vs 0.0027），\n      CodeLlama 高 ~7x。这使 \"calibration as secondary evidence\" 从 universal\n      finding 降级为 model-dependent finding。\n      \n      然而，calibration improvement ratio (exc vs no_trace) 在所有模型上都存在\n      （3.4x-63x），只是 magnitude model-dependent。论文可保留 \"exception signal\n      improves calibration\" claim 但需加 \"magnitude varies across models\" qualifier。\n      \n      DeepSeek 的 poor calibration (ECE=0.0523) 与其 accuracy (99.33%) 的 disconnect\n      呼应 D1 (eval_loss vs accuracy decoupling)——token-level confidence 与\n      sample-level correctness decoupled。审稿人可能质疑: 如果 calibration 是\n      model-dependent 的，那 calibration evidence 对 Claim 1 的 supporting 作用\n      大打折扣。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_020: Few-shot prompting baseline (GPT-4o / Claude)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"few_shot_frontier_baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020\"\n    description: \"GPT-4o / Claude 直接判断 pass/fail (0-shot + 3-shot)，与 SFT exception_only 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      gpt4o:\n        zero_shot_no_trace:\n          accuracy: 0.823\n          pass_f1: 0.876\n          fail_f1: 0.687\n        zero_shot_exception_only:\n          accuracy: 0.955\n          pass_f1: 0.970\n          fail_f1: 0.918\n        three_shot_exception_only:\n          accuracy: 0.972\n          pass_f1: 0.981\n          fail_f1: 0.950\n      claude_sonnet:\n        zero_shot_no_trace:\n          accuracy: 0.808\n          pass_f1: 0.862\n          fail_f1: 0.667\n        zero_shot_exception_only:\n          accuracy: 0.948\n          pass_f1: 0.965\n          fail_f1: 0.908\n        three_shot_exception_only:\n          accuracy: 0.965\n          pass_f1: 0.977\n          fail_f1: 0.934\n      sft_exception_only_qwen7b:\n        accuracy: 0.9983\n        pass_f1: 0.999\n        fail_f1: 0.997\n      gap_best_fewshot_vs_sft_pp: 2.63\n      gap_pvalue: 0.001\n      api_cost_per_1190_samples_gpt4o: \"$12-18\"\n      sft_inference_cost_per_1190: \"$0.02-0.05\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPT-4o 0-shot no_trace (82.3%): frontier model 可以从 code + test case\n      推断 correctness，但受限于 cannot actually execute code。类似我们的 no_trace\n      baseline (75.13%)，但 GPT-4o 的 code understanding 远强于 Qwen-7B base，\n      因此 +7pp。\n\n      GPT-4o 0-shot exception_only (95.5%): 给出 exception trace 后，GPT-4o 能\n      准确判断 \"[ERROR] TypeError\" → fail, \"[No exception]\" → pass。但 GPT-4o 在\n      borderline cases（如 GeneratorExit）的判断与 SFT 模型类似——看到 [ERROR] 就\n      倾向判 fail。同时 GPT-4o 对 exception_only format 未经微调，可能对某些\n      formatting 不够 sensitive，导致 ~4.5% error rate。\n\n      GPT-4o 3-shot exception_only (97.2%): 3 个 examples 帮助 GPT-4o 理解\n      exception_only format 的 exact semantics，减少 formatting-related errors。\n      但仍有 ~2.8% error rate——主要来自 (1) GeneratorExit-like ambiguity,\n      (2) multi-exception traces where GPT-4o must judge severity,\n      (3) occasional refusal to make binary judgment on ambiguous cases。\n\n      SFT gap (2.63pp): 虽小但 statistically significant (n=1190, p=0.001)。\n      然而审稿人会质疑: \"2.63pp 值得 SFT pipeline 的 engineering effort 吗?\"\n\n      Claude Sonnet 略低于 GPT-4o (~0.7pp)，因为 code-specific training data\n      量可能略少。\n\n      Worst 档影响: few-shot baseline 接近 SFT，削弱 \"SFT is necessary\" narrative。\n      但可以 reframe: (1) SFT 7B 的推理成本比 GPT-4o API 低 ~300x;\n      (2) SFT calibration (ECE=0.0027) 远优于 GPT-4o prompt-based output;\n      (3) SFT 可 offline deploy 无 API dependency;\n      (4) 核心 finding 仍然 valid: exception signal 是 key，无论 SFT 还是 few-shot。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"SFT vs Few-shot vs Zero-shot comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {method: \"SFT exception_only (Qwen-7B)\", accuracy: \"99.83%\", cost_per_1190: \"~$0.03\", latency_ms: \"~50\", calibration_ece: 0.0027}\n          - {method: \"GPT-4o 3-shot + exception\", accuracy: \"97.2%\", cost_per_1190: \"~$15\", latency_ms: \"~2000\", calibration_ece: \"N/A (no logits)\"}\n          - {method: \"GPT-4o 0-shot + exception\", accuracy: \"95.5%\", cost_per_1190: \"~$12\", latency_ms: \"~2000\", calibration_ece: \"N/A\"}\n          - {method: \"Claude 3-shot + exception\", accuracy: \"96.5%\", cost_per_1190: \"~$10\", latency_ms: \"~1800\", calibration_ece: \"N/A\"}\n          - {method: \"GPT-4o 0-shot no trace\", accuracy: \"82.3%\", cost_per_1190: \"~$8\", latency_ms: \"~1500\", calibration_ece: \"N/A\"}\n          - {method: \"SFT no_trace (Qwen-7B)\", accuracy: \"75.1%\", cost_per_1190: \"~$0.02\", latency_ms: \"~30\", calibration_ece: 0.1715}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: accuracy × method。SFT exception_only 最高但与 GPT-4o 3-shot 的 gap 视觉上不大。需要 inset 或 zoomed panel 展示 97-100% 区间的差异。附加 cost annotation 展示 300x cost saving。\"\n    analysis: >\n      在 worst 档下，few-shot baseline 是论文最大的 narrative threat 之一。\n      GPT-4o 3-shot 97.2% vs SFT 99.83% 的 2.63pp gap 虽 significant，\n      但审稿人会提出两个攻击:\n      \n      (1) \"如果 GPT-4o 加更多 examples 或 chain-of-thought 就能追上 SFT？\"\n      → 无法反驳，因为我们没测。但 3-shot 已经 nearly saturated（0-shot 95.5%\n      → 3-shot 97.2%, diminishing returns），extrapolation 不太可能到 99.8%。\n      \n      (2) \"SFT 的 marginal 2.63pp 不值得 training pipeline 的复杂度\"\n      → 需用 cost argument (300x cheaper) + calibration argument (ECE=0.0027\n      vs GPT-4o no logits) + offline deployment 来反驳。\n      \n      Reframe: few-shot 结果实际上 STRENGTHENS \"exception signal is key\" claim\n      ——even frontier models benefit most from exception trace (+13pp for GPT-4o)。\n      SFT 的 advantage 是 practical (cost/calibration)，不是 signal discovery。\n      Signal discovery (exception > everything else) 是 universal finding，\n      无论 SFT 还是 prompting。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_021: OOD generalization\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"ood_generalization_test\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_021\"\n    description: \"在不同编程语言/项目的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\"\n    expected_results:\n      python_ood_dataset:\n        name: \"LeetCode-style problems (different distribution from HumanEval/MBPP)\"\n        exception_only: 0.871\n        vota: 0.793\n        no_trace: 0.682\n        exception_lift_over_notrace: 0.189\n      cross_language:\n        feasibility: \"NOT_FEASIBLE_WITHIN_TIMELINE\"\n        reason: \"需要新的 trace collection pipeline for Java/JS/C++; exception format 跨语言差异大\"\n      domain_shift_analysis:\n        in_distribution_exc_accuracy: 0.9983\n        ood_exc_accuracy: 0.871\n        degradation_pp: 12.7\n        relative_ordering_preserved: true\n        exception_still_best_on_ood: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Python OOD (LeetCode-style): 训练数据来自 HumanEval + MBPP-sanitized (591\n      problems)，这些是 relatively simple、well-defined 的编程题。LeetCode-style\n      problems 更复杂（涉及 DP, graph algorithms, complex data structures），\n      exception patterns 可能包含 training 未见过的 error types (e.g., RecursionError,\n      MemoryError, complex nested exceptions)。\n\n      exception_only 87.1%: 下降 12.7pp 因为 (1) unseen exception types —— 模型\n      对 RecursionError 等 training 中罕见的 exception 缺乏 calibrated 判断;\n      (2) OOD problems 的 pass/fail 比例可能不同 (training = 71.5% pass);\n      (3) LeetCode problems 可能有 time limit exceeded 等 non-exception failures\n      ——代码不抛异常但 output 错误——exception_only 表征中这些显示为 \"[No exception]\"\n      但 label=fail，模型在 OOD 上对这类 pattern 的 confusion 更大。\n\n      VOTA 79.3%: 更大的 degradation (20.1pp) 因为 VOTA 的 loop compression\n      和 ae extraction 对 LeetCode trace 结构的 assumption 不 match——\n      complex data structures 的 trace 不 follow 简单的 loop iteration pattern。\n\n      no_trace 68.2%: 下降 7pp，说明 LeetCode problems 本身 harder（更难从\n      code alone 判断 correctness），但 degradation 较小因为 no_trace 的 ceiling\n      本来就低。\n\n      Relative ordering preserved (exception > VOTA > no_trace) 是正面信号——\n      说明 exception dominance 的 conclusion generalizes even if absolute\n      numbers drop。但 12.7pp degradation 被审稿人 ammunition: \"model overfits\n      to HumanEval/MBPP exception distribution\"。\n\n      Cross-language (Java/JS/C++): 在 deadline 前 NOT FEASIBLE。需要:\n      (1) trace collection infrastructure per language (Java Jacoco/bytecode,\n      JS Istanbul, C++ sanitizers); (2) exception format normalization\n      (Java stack traces ≠ Python tracebacks); (3) test suite per language。\n      估计 3-4 weeks 工作量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"OOD generalization results\"\n        data:\n          - {condition: \"exception_only\", in_dist: \"99.83%\", ood_python: \"87.1%\", delta: \"-12.7pp\"}\n          - {condition: \"VOTA\", in_dist: \"99.41%\", ood_python: \"79.3%\", delta: \"-20.1pp\"}\n          - {condition: \"no_trace\", in_dist: \"75.13%\", ood_python: \"68.2%\", delta: \"-6.9pp\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: in-distribution vs OOD for 3 conditions。所有条件都有 degradation 但 relative ordering preserved。exception_only 的 degradation (-12.7pp) 居中——比 VOTA (-20.1pp) 小但比 no_trace (-6.9pp) 大。\"\n    analysis: >\n      OOD 泛化性在 worst 档下是 mixed 结果。正面: relative ordering preserved,\n      exception_only 仍为最佳。负面: 12.7pp degradation 说明 exception_only 的\n      near-perfect in-distribution accuracy 部分依赖于 HumanEval/MBPP 的 exception\n      pattern 分布（dominated by TypeError, ValueError, AssertionError），\n      对 unseen exception types 的 generalization 有限。\n\n      对论文的影响: OOD 结果不应放入 main paper（太弱），只在 Discussion 提\n      generalization limitation + future work。跨语言完全不可行，成为 explicit\n      limitation。审稿人关于 \"single task, single dataset\" 的 concern 在 OOD\n      数据上部分证实——exception signal 的 universality 限于 similar exception\n      distributions。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_022: Training dynamics\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"training_dynamics_comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_022\"\n    description: \"exception_only vs full_trace 的 learning curve (每 50 steps eval)\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_curve:\n        step_0: 0.50\n        step_50: 0.962\n        step_100: 0.991\n        step_150: 0.995\n        step_200: 0.998\n        step_250: 0.998\n        convergence_step: 100\n      full_trace_curve:\n        step_0: 0.50\n        step_50: 0.721\n        step_100: 0.768\n        step_150: 0.803\n        step_200: 0.812\n        step_250: 0.818\n        convergence_step: 200\n      speed_ratio: 2.0  # exception_only converges ~2x faster in steps\n      exception_step50_vs_full_converged: \"+14.4pp\"\n      curve_noise:\n        exception_only_step_std: 0.003\n        full_trace_step_std: 0.018\n    result_rationale: >\n      exception_only: signal 结构简单（[ERROR] type: ... 或 [No exception]），\n      模型在 ~50 steps 即能学到 binary mapping（有 exception → fail, 无 → pass），\n      此后 refinement 主要是 calibration improvement 和 edge cases。Step 50\n      的 96.2% 已经超过 full_trace 的最终 converged accuracy (81.8%)。\n      这支持 information density 假说——exception signal 的 signal-to-noise ratio\n      极高，学习效率自然高。\n\n      full_trace: 模型需要从 long, noisy traces 中学到什么是 relevant，\n      这本身就是一个 learning problem。Step 50 时模型刚开始区分 trace structure\n      (72.1%≈no_trace baseline + few pp)，到 step 200 才稳定在 ~82%。\n      Step-to-step variance (std=0.018 per step) 比 exception_only (0.003) 高 6x，\n      说明 full_trace 的 optimization landscape 更 noisy。\n\n      Speed ratio 2x: exception_only 在 ~100 steps converge，full_trace 在 ~200\n      steps。ratio 只有 2x（不是 10x）因为两者都使用相同的 LoRA rank 和 learning\n      rate——exception_only 的主要优势是 ceiling height (99.83% vs 81.8%)，不是\n      convergence speed 本身。\n\n      Worst 档 caveat: curves are noisy（尤其 full_trace），step-to-step\n      fluctuations 使 figure 不够 clean for publication。exception_only curve\n      在 step 50 之后几乎 flat（从 96.2% → 99.8%，3.6pp over 200 steps），\n      作为 learning curve figure 不 visually interesting。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Learning curve milestones\"\n        data:\n          - {condition: \"exception_only\", step_50: \"96.2%\", step_100: \"99.1%\", step_200: \"99.8%\", final: \"99.83%\", converge_step: 100}\n          - {condition: \"full_trace\", step_50: \"72.1%\", step_100: \"76.8%\", step_200: \"81.2%\", final: \"81.8%\", converge_step: 200}\n          - {condition: \"no_trace\", step_50: \"71.5%\", step_100: \"73.8%\", step_200: \"75.0%\", final: \"75.1%\", converge_step: 150}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve plot (accuracy vs training steps): 3 条线 + shaded CI bands。exception_only 在 step 50 处几乎 vertical rise 后 flat；full_trace 缓慢爬升但 noisy（visible step-to-step jitter）；no_trace 几乎 flat 从 start。X-axis 需要 log scale 或 zoom panel 来展示 exception_only 的 early rise。Overall: informative but not publication-quality due to noise and the exception_only curve being essentially a step function。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Training dynamics 在 worst 档下提供 supporting evidence 但不够强作为\n      独立 contribution。核心 finding (exception_only 收敛更快) 是 expected\n      且 trivial——simpler signal naturally easier to learn。2x speed ratio\n      不够 dramatic（如果是 10x 则更有 narrative value）。\n\n      对论文的影响: 可在 Appendix 放 learning curve figure 作为 supplementary\n      evidence for Claim 2 (information density)。但不应作为 main result——\n      审稿人会说 \"of course simpler signals converge faster, this is not\n      a contribution\"。\n\n      唯一 novel 的 data point: exception_only step 50 (96.2%) > full_trace\n      final (81.8%)。这意味着 exception_only 在仅 1/6 的训练时间内就超越了\n      full_trace 的 theoretical ceiling。可以用一句话在 Results 中提及，\n      但不值得 dedicated subsection。\n```\n\n**总结**: worst 档下 7 个 planned 实验中，budget curve 相关的 plan_016 和 plan_017 产出最差——4 模型模式完全分裂，CodeLlama W-shape 不可解释，seed robustness 也 model-dependent。plan_018-022 提供 supplementary value 但无独立 contribution。论文唯一可靠的 anchor 仍是 exception_only 的 cross-model dominance (99.83% × 4 models on best seeds)。Budget curve 整体移入 Appendix，reframe 为 \"why exception_only is preferable to length-dependent approaches\" 的反面教材。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41698,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41698},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2ab8c5fb-4182-4e41-aa76-fa6d46b502a0","uuid":"88deb9fb-82aa-414f-ac50-c1c9c50a1802"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":501792,"duration_api_ms":503663,"num_turns":1,"result":"我先梳理所有 planned 实验的上下文数据，然后在 worst 档下展开预测。\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Budget curve 4 模型间模式完全分裂，无法提炼 universal phase transition pattern。\n  Qwen-7B gradual, Qwen-1.5B sharp, DeepSeek early-onset, CodeLlama multi-point anomaly。\n  Budget curve 必须从 Results → Appendix supplementary。论文 headline 收缩为：\n  \"Exception events as the only universally robust trace signal — all other trace\n  components and budget-length relationships are model-dependent.\" Error analysis\n  和 cross-model calibration 也出现 model-dependency，无法作为独立 contribution。\n  Few-shot GPT-4o baseline 接近 SFT 水平（~97% vs 99.83%），需用 cost efficiency +\n  calibration superiority 辩护 SFT 价值。OOD 泛化性有限。Reframe 策略: 以 exception\n  dominance 的 simplicity + universality 为唯一 anchor，将所有 model-dependent 发现\n  转化为 \"simplicity is robustness\" 的反面教材。EMNLP Main 概率 15-30%。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_016: Fine-grained phase transition — tail-384 × 4 models\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"qwen7b_full_trace_tail384_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B tail-384 truncation，定位 256→512 transition 位置\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.847\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.826\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.868\n      majority_baseline: 0.7151\n      lift_over_majority: 0.132\n      pass_precision: 0.905\n      pass_recall: 0.875\n      pass_f1: 0.890\n      fail_precision: 0.710\n      fail_recall: 0.780\n      fail_f1: 0.743\n      n_test: 1190\n      train_loss: 0.088\n      eval_loss: 0.41\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen-7B tail-256=77.48%, tail-512=93.6%。384 tokens 在 worst 档下处于 transition\n      中段——提供了约 50% 的 tail-end diagnostic content（包含部分 exception/assertion 数据\n      但不完整）。Qwen-7B 的 LoRA landscape 平滑（3-seed exception_only variance=0），\n      因此即使在 noisy intermediate length 上也能稳定学到部分模式。但 384 tokens 不足以\n      覆盖多数 fail 样本的完整 exception trace（exception 通常在 trace 最后 200-500 tokens），\n      导致 ~50% 的 fail 样本 exception 信息被截断。结果: gradual rise，interpolating between\n      256 and 512，约 84.7%。这使 Qwen-7B 成为 \"gradual transition\" 模式的代表——\n      与 Qwen-1.5B 的 sharp transition 形成对比，破坏 universal pattern 叙事。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Qwen-7B budget curve (updated)\"\n        data:\n          - {length: \"tail-256\", accuracy: \"77.48%\", delta_vs_prev: \"—\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-384\", accuracy: \"84.7%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+7.2pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-512\", accuracy: \"93.6%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+8.9pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-1024\", accuracy: \"96.5%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+2.9pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-2048\", accuracy: \"97.3%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+0.8pp\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Qwen-7B curve 呈现平滑 S-shape，拐点在 384-512 之间。transition 是 gradual 而非 sharp——两个相邻 128-token 区间各贡献约 7-9pp。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen-7B 是 4 模型中唯一呈现 clean monotonic + gradual transition 的模型。\n      然而 \"gradual\" 意味着无法定义 discrete phase transition point，削弱\n      \"sharp phase transition\" claim。如果其他模型也 gradual 则可声称 universal\n      gradual pattern；但其他模型模式不同，Qwen-7B 的 gradual 反而成为 model-specific\n      behavior 的证据。\n\n  - name: \"qwen15b_full_trace_tail384_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B tail-384，验证小模型 transition timing\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.745\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.720\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.769\n      majority_baseline: 0.7151\n      lift_over_majority: 0.030\n      pass_precision: 0.835\n      pass_recall: 0.810\n      pass_f1: 0.822\n      fail_precision: 0.545\n      fail_recall: 0.590\n      fail_f1: 0.567\n      n_test: 1190\n      train_loss: 0.25\n      eval_loss: 0.56\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen-1.5B tail-256=72.6%, tail-512=95.6%。这个模型在 exception_only 上\n      与 7B 完全一致（99.83%），但在 noisy full_trace 上更脆弱（head-2048 仅 75.3%\n      vs 7B 的 81.6%）。1.5B 模型容量有限，需要更完整的 diagnostic signal 才能\n      学到有用模式——384 tokens 提供的 partial information 对它来说 insufficient，\n      无法从噪声中提取信号。结果: 仅比 tail-256 提升 ~2pp，仍接近 baseline。\n      真正的 phase transition 发生在 384→512 之间（+21pp 的巨大跳跃），显示\n      512 tokens 是该模型的 critical threshold——刚好覆盖大多数 fail 样本的完整\n      exception + assertion 信息。这是 \"sharp transition\" 模式，但 threshold\n      位置 (384-512) 与 Qwen-7B 的 gradual zone 不同。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Qwen-1.5B budget curve (updated)\"\n        data:\n          - {length: \"tail-256\", accuracy: \"72.6%\", delta_vs_prev: \"—\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-384\", accuracy: \"74.5%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+1.9pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-512\", accuracy: \"95.6%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+21.1pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-1024\", accuracy: \"96.6%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+1.0pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-2048\", accuracy: \"97.9%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+1.3pp\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Qwen-1.5B 呈现 step function: 384→512 处有 ~21pp 的 cliff jump，之前和之后都近乎 flat。与 Qwen-7B 的 gradual curve 形成鲜明对比。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen-1.5B 的 sharp transition 说明小模型的 information utilization threshold\n      更高——384 tokens 的 partial trace 对 1.5B 几乎无用，但 512 tokens 突然\n      提供了 sufficient signal。这与 exception_only 的 scale-invariance（1.5B=7B=99.83%）\n      形成 interesting 对比：exception signal 因其 structural simplicity 对模型容量\n      无要求，但 full_trace 的 utilization threshold 是 capacity-dependent。然而\n      这一 finding 无法 universalize——同 scale/同 family 的 7B 模型呈现完全不同\n      的 gradual pattern。\n\n  - name: \"deepseek_full_trace_tail384_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B tail-384，验证 alternative architecture transition\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.883\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.863\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.902\n      majority_baseline: 0.7151\n      lift_over_majority: 0.168\n      pass_precision: 0.920\n      pass_recall: 0.915\n      pass_f1: 0.917\n      fail_precision: 0.792\n      fail_recall: 0.805\n      fail_f1: 0.798\n      n_test: 1190\n      train_loss: 0.15\n      eval_loss: 0.38\n    result_rationale: >\n      DeepSeek tail-256=76.4%, tail-512=93.9%。DeepSeek tokenizer 在 tail 区域\n      的 token density 不同于 Qwen（不同 BPE vocabulary），384 DeepSeek tokens\n      覆盖更多字符内容。加之 DeepSeek 在 full_trace 条件下对 fail 模式的学习\n      更快（tail-2048 已 95%），transition 更早发生。88.3% 说明 DeepSeek 在 384\n      tokens 时已经获得了大部分 diagnostic information——与 Qwen-7B (84.7%) 和\n      Qwen-1.5B (74.5%) 形成第三种不同模式：\"early-onset transition\"。但这也暴露了\n      DeepSeek tail-2048 (95.0%) 相对 tail-1024 (96.5%) 的轻微非单调性——\n      longer context 引入 noise。整体模式: 提前进入 transition + 后端轻微 regression。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"DeepSeek budget curve (updated)\"\n        data:\n          - {length: \"tail-256\", accuracy: \"76.4%\", delta_vs_prev: \"—\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-384\", accuracy: \"88.3%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+11.9pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-512\", accuracy: \"93.9%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+5.6pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-1024\", accuracy: \"96.5%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+2.6pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-2048\", accuracy: \"95.0%\", delta_vs_prev: \"-1.5pp\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"DeepSeek curve 左移，在 256→384 已有 +11.9pp 大幅上升，但在 tail-2048 处轻微回落（-1.5pp），呈现 inverted-U tail。\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek 的 early-onset transition 与 Qwen 两模型模式都不同。可能原因:\n      (1) tokenizer efficiency 不同导致同 token 数覆盖不同内容量；\n      (2) 预训练数据差异导致 trace 理解的 readiness 不同。\n      tail-2048 的轻微 regression 虽小（-1.5pp, 可能在 CI 内），但与 CodeLlama\n      的灾难性 regression 构成连续谱，暗示 long-context full_trace 对 SFT 有普遍\n      的 diminishing/negative returns 趋势——但程度完全 model-specific。\n\n  - name: \"codellama13b_full_trace_tail384_seed42\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct tail-384，验证 LLaMA family transition\"\n    expected_results:\n      accuracy: 0.735\n      accuracy_ci_lower: 0.711\n      accuracy_ci_upper: 0.760\n      majority_baseline: 0.7151\n      lift_over_majority: 0.020\n      pass_precision: 0.800\n      pass_recall: 0.845\n      pass_f1: 0.822\n      fail_precision: 0.555\n      fail_recall: 0.458\n      fail_f1: 0.502\n      n_test: 1190\n      train_loss: 0.28\n      eval_loss: 0.62\n    result_rationale: >\n      CodeLlama tail-256=77.9%, tail-512=97.5%。在 worst 档下 CodeLlama tail-384\n      出现 anomalous dip——accuracy 73.5% 低于 tail-256 (77.9%) 4.4pp。根因假说:\n      CodeLlama tokenizer 在 384-token window 内截取到 trace 中间位置的 ambiguous\n      content（包含 partial loop iterations 但 exception 被截断），形成比 tail-256\n      更具误导性的输入。tail-256 因内容极少反而让模型回退到 no_trace-like 的保守策略\n      （~78%≈no_trace+few pp），而 tail-384 提供了 \"just enough to be dangerous\"\n      的 partial information——模型看到了 execution trace 但缺少 diagnostic conclusion，\n      导致 fail_recall 大幅下降 (0.458)。这与 CodeLlama 在 tail-2048 (41.8%) 的\n      catastrophic failure 以及 tail-1024 v2 的不稳定 (87.6%) 构成系统性 pattern:\n      CodeLlama 对 intermediate-noise trace 特别脆弱。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"CodeLlama budget curve (updated)\"\n        data:\n          - {length: \"tail-256\", accuracy: \"77.9%\", delta_vs_prev: \"—\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-384\", accuracy: \"73.5%\", delta_vs_prev: \"-4.4pp ⚠️\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-512\", accuracy: \"97.5%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+24.0pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-1024\", accuracy: \"98.2%\", delta_vs_prev: \"+0.7pp\"}\n          - {length: \"tail-2048\", accuracy: \"41.8%\", delta_vs_prev: \"-56.4pp ⚠️\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"CodeLlama curve 呈 W-shape: 77.9→73.5→97.5→98.2→41.8。两个 anomalous dip (384, 2048)，中间有一个极窄的 peak band (512-1024)。这种 chaotic budget curve 是审稿人攻击的主要靶点。\"\n    analysis: >\n      CodeLlama 的 multi-point anomaly 使 budget curve 作为 universal contribution\n      彻底失效。任何试图 fit a universal curve 的尝试都会被 CodeLlama 的 W-shape 击碎。\n      审稿人会质疑 training pipeline 健壮性——为什么同一 codebase 对 CodeLlama\n      产生如此不稳定的结果？回应策略: (1) 诚实报告所有数据; (2) 指出 CodeLlama 的\n      LLaMA tokenizer 与 code-specific tokenizers (Qwen/DeepSeek) 的效率差异导致\n      同 token 数对应不同 content coverage; (3) 将 CodeLlama 的 instability 作为\n      \"why simplicity matters\" 的反面论据——exception_only 在 CodeLlama 上 99.83%\n      完美，不受 length budget 影响。\n\n  - name: \"plan_016_cross_model_synthesis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"tail-384 × 4 模型交叉分析: phase transition 模式分裂总结\"\n    expected_results:\n      tail384_cross_model_std_pp: 6.4\n      tail384_cross_model_range_pp: 14.8  # 88.3 - 73.5\n      phase_transition_sharpness: 0.2\n      budget_curve_consistent_models: 1\n      transition_patterns:\n        qwen7b: \"gradual_monotonic\"\n        qwen15b: \"sharp_delayed\"\n        deepseek: \"early_onset_with_tail_regression\"\n        codellama: \"non_monotonic_W_shape\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      4 模型呈现 4 种不同的 budget curve 形态。phase_transition_sharpness=0.2 因为\n      只有 Qwen-1.5B 显示真正的 sharp transition (tail-384→512 跳 21pp)，其他\n      模型要么 gradual (Qwen-7B)、要么 early-onset (DeepSeek)、要么 anomalous\n      (CodeLlama)。budget_curve_consistent_models=1 因为只有 Qwen-7B 呈现 clean\n      monotonic pattern（DeepSeek 有 tail regression, CodeLlama 有两处 anomaly,\n      Qwen-1.5B 虽 monotonic 但 step-function 形态不同于 Qwen-7B 的 gradual）。\n      Cross-model std=6.4pp 在 [5,12] 范围内。这证明 budget curve 形态是\n      model-specific 的——无法提炼 universal trace-length → accuracy pattern。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-model tail-384 comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {model: \"Qwen-7B\", tail256: \"77.5%\", tail384: \"84.7%\", tail512: \"93.6%\", delta_256_384: \"+7.2pp\", delta_384_512: \"+8.9pp\", pattern: \"gradual\"}\n          - {model: \"Qwen-1.5B\", tail256: \"72.6%\", tail384: \"74.5%\", tail512: \"95.6%\", delta_256_384: \"+1.9pp\", delta_384_512: \"+21.1pp\", pattern: \"sharp_delayed\"}\n          - {model: \"DeepSeek\", tail256: \"76.4%\", tail384: \"88.3%\", tail512: \"93.9%\", delta_256_384: \"+11.9pp\", delta_384_512: \"+5.6pp\", pattern: \"early_onset\"}\n          - {model: \"CodeLlama\", tail256: \"77.9%\", tail384: \"73.5%\", tail512: \"97.5%\", delta_256_384: \"-4.4pp\", delta_384_512: \"+24.0pp\", pattern: \"non_monotonic\"}\n      - name: \"Full budget curve matrix (all models)\"\n        data:\n          - {model: \"Qwen-7B\", t256: \"77.5\", t384: \"84.7\", t512: \"93.6\", t1024: \"96.5\", t2048: \"97.3\", monotonic: \"✓\", pattern: \"gradual S-curve\"}\n          - {model: \"Qwen-1.5B\", t256: \"72.6\", t384: \"74.5\", t512: \"95.6\", t1024: \"96.6\", t2048: \"97.9\", monotonic: \"✓\", pattern: \"step function at 512\"}\n          - {model: \"DeepSeek\", t256: \"76.4\", t384: \"88.3\", t512: \"93.9\", t1024: \"96.5\", t2048: \"95.0\", monotonic: \"✗\", pattern: \"early rise + tail regression\"}\n          - {model: \"CodeLlama\", t256: \"77.9\", t384: \"73.5\", t512: \"97.5\", t1024: \"98.2\", t2048: \"41.8\", monotonic: \"✗\", pattern: \"W-shape with 2 anomalies\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4-model budget curve overlay plot: x-axis = tail token budget (256/384/512/1024/2048), y-axis = accuracy。4 条曲线形态完全不同——Qwen-7B 平滑 S-curve, Qwen-1.5B 在 512 处有 cliff, DeepSeek 早期上升+后端轻微下降, CodeLlama 呈 W-shape。无法 fit 任何 universal trend line。exception_only 水平线 (99.83%) 在所有 budget 值上方，强调 length budget 对 exception signal 无关。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Budget curve 作为 contribution 在 worst 档下完全失效。4 模型 4 种模式，\n      无法声称 \"trace length has a universal effect on verdict accuracy\"。\n      唯一 universal 的 finding 是 exception_only (99.83%) 在所有模型上不受\n      length budget 影响——这反而强化了 \"simplicity is robustness\" 的 headline。\n      Budget curve 应移至 Appendix，仅作为 \"why exception_only is preferable\"\n      的 supporting evidence：同 token budget 下 full_trace 的效果完全不可预测，\n      而 exception_only 无此问题。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_017: Cross-seed budget curve — tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"cross_seed_budget_curve_tail512\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_017\"\n    description: \"tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds，验证 phase transition 后 convergence band robustness\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b:\n        seed42: 0.936\n        seed123: 0.924\n        seed456: 0.931\n        mean: 0.930\n        std_pp: 0.6\n        range_pp: 1.2\n      qwen15b:\n        seed42: 0.956\n        seed123: 0.908\n        seed456: 0.942\n        mean: 0.935\n        std_pp: 2.5\n        range_pp: 4.8\n      deepseek:\n        seed42: 0.939\n        seed123: 0.876\n        seed456: 0.919\n        mean: 0.911\n        std_pp: 3.2\n        range_pp: 6.3\n      codellama:\n        seed42: 0.975\n        seed123: 0.809\n        seed456: 0.943\n        mean: 0.909\n        std_pp: 8.7\n        range_pp: 16.6\n      overall_cross_model_seed_std_mean: 3.75\n    result_rationale: >\n      tail-512 是 transition 后的第一个 \"高 accuracy\" 点，但在 worst 档下 seed\n      robustness 与 signal complexity 正相关。exception_only（最简信号）seed variance\n      已知: Qwen 0pp, DeepSeek 4.8pp (σ)。full_trace tail-512 的 signal 远比\n      exception_only complex（包含 loop iterations, variable states, partial traces），\n      因此 seed sensitivity 应更严重。\n\n      Qwen-7B: LoRA landscape 平滑（exception_only 3-seed variance=0），tail-512\n      的 seed variance 也最小（σ=0.6pp）。但即使 Qwen-7B 也有 ~1pp 波动——\n      full_trace 信号的 noise 导致不同 seed 的 LoRA 从 trace 中学到略微不同的\n      patterns。\n\n      Qwen-1.5B: 容量限制放大 seed sensitivity。在 exception_only 上 scale-invariant\n      (99.83%)，但 full_trace 依赖 execution reasoning——1.5B 的 reasoning 容量\n      有限，seed123 未能充分学到 trace→verdict 映射。σ=2.5pp，moderate。\n\n      DeepSeek: 已知 LoRA initialization sensitivity（exception_only seed123=91.09%\n      vs seed42/456=99.33%）。full_trace 放大此效应。seed123 再次成为 outlier\n      (87.6%)，但 gap 不如 exception_only 的 seed123 极端——因为 full_trace 的\n      ceiling 本身较低（~94%），outlier seed 的退化空间也较小。σ=3.2pp。\n\n      CodeLlama: training instability 的系统性问题。已知 tail-1024 有 run-to-run\n      variance (87.6% vs 98.2%)，tail-2048 catastrophic。tail-512 虽然是 CodeLlama\n      的 \"sweet spot\"（single seed=97.5%），但 seed variance 极大——seed123 仅\n      80.9%，几乎 17pp 退化。根因: CodeLlama 的 LLaMA tokenizer 对 code trace\n      的 tokenization 效率低，512 tokens 覆盖内容较少，不同 seed 的 LoRA 可能\n      focus on different trace regions，导致 catastrophic divergence。σ=8.7pp\n      使 CodeLlama 的 budget curve 在 seed 维度也不 robust。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds\"\n        data:\n          - {model: \"Qwen-7B\", seed42: \"93.6%\", seed123: \"92.4%\", seed456: \"93.1%\", mean: \"93.0%\", std: \"0.6pp\", verdict: \"✓ robust\"}\n          - {model: \"Qwen-1.5B\", seed42: \"95.6%\", seed123: \"90.8%\", seed456: \"94.2%\", mean: \"93.5%\", std: \"2.5pp\", verdict: \"△ moderate\"}\n          - {model: \"DeepSeek\", seed42: \"93.9%\", seed123: \"87.6%\", seed456: \"91.9%\", mean: \"91.1%\", std: \"3.2pp\", verdict: \"△ moderate\"}\n          - {model: \"CodeLlama\", seed42: \"97.5%\", seed123: \"80.9%\", seed456: \"94.3%\", mean: \"90.9%\", std: \"8.7pp\", verdict: \"✗ unstable\"}\n      - name: \"对比: exception_only seed robustness\"\n        data:\n          - {model: \"Qwen-7B\", exc_std: \"0.00pp\", tail512_std: \"0.6pp\", ratio: \"∞\"}\n          - {model: \"Qwen-1.5B\", exc_std: \"0.00pp (单 seed)\", tail512_std: \"2.5pp\", ratio: \"—\"}\n          - {model: \"DeepSeek\", exc_std: \"4.8pp\", tail512_std: \"3.2pp\", ratio: \"0.67\"}\n          - {model: \"CodeLlama\", exc_std: \"0.10pp\", tail512_std: \"8.7pp\", ratio: \"87x\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Violin plot / box plot: 每个模型一列，3 seeds 为点。Qwen-7B 紧密聚拢，CodeLlama 大幅分散。overlaid horizontal line at exception_only accuracy (99.83%) 强调: 即使 tail-512 的 best seed (CodeLlama 97.5%) 也不及 exception_only，且 seed stability 远不如。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-seed robustness 进一步削弱 budget curve contribution。即使在 tail-512\n      这个 \"transition 后最稳定\" 的点，4 模型中只有 Qwen-7B 真正 seed-robust。\n      CodeLlama 的 σ=8.7pp 使其 single-seed 数据完全不可信——97.5% 可能只是\n      lucky seed。这意味着论文中报告的所有 single-seed budget curve 数据点都有\n      潜在的 seed noise 问题，但我们不可能为每个 length × model 组合都跑 3 seeds\n      （预算 24 GPU-hours 只够 tail-512 这一个点）。\n      \n      对论文的影响: (1) budget curve 的可信度进一步下降——不仅 model-specific，\n      还 seed-sensitive; (2) exception_only 的 seed robustness（Qwen 0pp, CodeLlama\n      0.1pp）与 full_trace tail-512 的 seed variance（CodeLlama 8.7pp）形成\n      87x 的对比，成为 \"simplicity enables robustness\" 的额外弹药; (3) 建议\n      仅在 Appendix 报告 tail-512 seed data，不 support 任何 main claim。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_018: Error analysis\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"error_analysis_cross_condition\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_018\"\n    description: \"用已有 predictions.jsonl 分析 4 条件的 failure modes\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_errors:\n        total: 2\n        all_generatorexit: true\n        sample_ids: [901, 905]\n        function: \"check_dict_case (HumanEval/95)\"\n        error_direction: \"pass→fail (false negative)\"\n        cross_seed_overlap: \"100% (3/3 seeds identical)\"\n      vota_errors:\n        total: 7\n        categories:\n          generatorexit: 2\n          long_trace_attention_dilution: 3\n          ambiguous_loop_pattern: 2\n        false_negative_rate: 0.71  # 5/7 are pass→fail\n        overlap_with_exception_only: 2  # same GeneratorExit samples\n      full_trace_errors:\n        total: 217\n        categories:\n          long_program_overload: 142\n          edge_case_subtle_bug: 38\n          correct_but_verbose_trace: 22\n          random_noise: 15\n        false_negative_rate: 0.62\n        median_trace_length_errors_vs_correct: \"2.3x longer\"\n      no_trace_errors:\n        total: 296\n        categories:\n          subtle_functional_bugs: 108\n          edge_case_only_failures: 87\n          correct_format_wrong_logic: 63\n          random: 38\n        false_negative_rate: 0.55\n        fail_recall: 0.735\n      cross_condition_overlap:\n        exc_intersect_vota: 0.286  # 2/7\n        vota_intersect_full: 0.714  # 5/7\n        full_intersect_no_trace: 0.691  # 150/217\n        exc_intersect_no_trace: 0.007  # 2/296\n    result_rationale: >\n      exception_only: 2 errors 已知且不可约（GeneratorExit），不提供新 insight。\n\n      VOTA: 7 errors 分为三类。(1) 2 个与 exception_only 重叠的 GeneratorExit——\n      inherited from Tier 1。(2) 3 个 long-trace samples 中 loop/ae tokens 稀释了\n      exception signal 的 attention——这些样本在 exception_only 下正确但 VOTA 下\n      错误，直接支持 \"Tier 2 introduces noise\" claim。(3) 2 个 ambiguous loop\n      patterns——loop 正常但有 exception，模型对 conflicting signals 做出错误判断。\n      这 7 个 error 的异质性使其无法归为单一 category。\n\n      full_trace: 217 errors 高度异质。最大类 (142/217) 是 long programs 的\n      information overload——trace 太长模型无法有效处理。38 个 edge case 中模型\n      看到了 trace 但未能正确 interpret 细微的 bug pattern。22 个 correct but\n      verbose——trace 的冗余信息误导模型预测 fail。这种高异质性使 error analysis\n      难以 yield actionable insight。\n\n      no_trace: 296 errors 中最大类是 subtle functional bugs (108)——没有 trace\n      时模型仅能依赖 code structure/style heuristics，对逻辑正确但风格 unusual 的\n      代码也会误判。fail_recall 仅 0.735 说明 ~27% 的 fail 样本被漏判。\n\n      Cross-condition overlap 低: exception_only 的 2 个 error 仅在 VOTA 的 7 个\n      error 中出现 2 个（28.6%），说明不同条件的 failure modes 几乎不重叠——\n      它们 fail on fundamentally different samples for fundamentally different reasons。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Error category distribution\"\n        data:\n          - {condition: \"exception_only\", n_errors: 2, primary_category: \"GeneratorExit (100%)\", actionable: \"No (irreducible)\"}\n          - {condition: \"VOTA\", n_errors: 7, primary_category: \"Mixed (GenExit 29% / attention dilution 43% / ambiguous loop 29%)\", actionable: \"Partial\"}\n          - {condition: \"full_trace\", n_errors: 217, primary_category: \"Long-trace overload (65%)\", actionable: \"Not without architecture change\"}\n          - {condition: \"no_trace\", n_errors: 296, primary_category: \"Subtle bugs undetectable from code alone (37%)\", actionable: \"No (inherent limitation)\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram 或 upset plot 展示 4 条件 error overlap。核心发现: overlap 极小，各条件 fail 在不同维度——但 figure 可能 too noisy for publication（296 vs 7 vs 2 的 scale 差异使 Venn 不 informative）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Error analysis 在 worst 档下产出有限。exception_only 的 2 个 error 已在\n      irreducible error analysis (D5) 中完全解析——无新 finding。VOTA 的 7 个 error\n      异质但数量太少不支撑 statistical analysis。full_trace 的 217 个 error 有\n      pattern（long traces dominant）但这是 Claim 2 已覆盖的 information overload\n      finding 的 restatement。no_trace 的 296 个 error 说明 baseline 弱但无新 insight。\n      \n      Cross-condition overlap 低本身是 interesting finding（不同 representations\n      fail on orthogonal dimensions），但在 worst 档下这无法 crystallize into a\n      clean narrative。建议: 仅在 Appendix 放 error breakdown table，Discussion\n      简短提及 orthogonal failure modes 现象。不值得作为独立 contribution。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_019: Cross-model calibration for exception_only\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"cross_model_calibration_exception_only\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_019\"\n    description: \"4 模型 × exception_only 的 ECE/Brier 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b:\n        ece: 0.0027\n        brier: 0.0013\n        mce: 0.835\n        accuracy: 0.9983\n      qwen15b:\n        ece: 0.0041\n        brier: 0.0019\n        mce: 0.72\n        accuracy: 0.9983\n      deepseek:\n        ece: 0.0523\n        brier: 0.0318\n        mce: 0.89\n        accuracy: 0.9933\n      codellama:\n        ece: 0.0183\n        brier: 0.0072\n        mce: 0.78\n        accuracy: 0.9983\n      cross_model_ece_std: 0.0225\n      cross_model_ece_range: 0.0496\n      universal_calibration: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen-7B ECE=0.0027 已知（近完美）。\n\n      Qwen-1.5B: exception_only accuracy 与 7B 完全相同 (99.83%)，但 1.5B 的\n      logit 分布可能略 less peaked（smaller model capacity → slightly more\n      uncertain probability outputs）。预测 ECE=0.0041，仍然 excellent。\n\n      DeepSeek: 这是 worst 档的关键分歧点。DeepSeek exception_only seed42=99.33%\n      （epoch3），但 epoch1=99.83%→epoch3=99.33% 的退化暗示 training 过程中\n      calibration 恶化。DeepSeek 的 LoRA 训练不稳定（seed123=91.09%）说明模型\n      的 probability landscape rugged。即使在 seed42 这个 \"好\" seed 上，model\n      的 predicted probabilities 可能 systematically miscalibrated——对 pass 样本\n      过度自信（many samples near 1.0 probability）但对 fail 样本 underconfident\n      （several samples in 0.3-0.6 range instead of near 0.0），导致 ECE=0.0523。\n      这不是灾难性的 miscalibration，但与 Qwen 的 0.0027 相差 ~19x，破坏了\n      \"universal near-perfect calibration\" 的叙事。Brier=0.0318 也偏高——\n      主要来自 8 个 error samples 的 high predicted pass probability。\n\n      CodeLlama: accuracy=99.83%（与 Qwen 相同），但 CodeLlama 的 LLaMA 架构\n      在 code domain 的 confidence distribution 不同。ECE=0.0183 处于中等水平——\n      优于 DeepSeek 但 ~7x worse than Qwen。可能原因: CodeLlama 虽然 accuracy\n      完美，但对少数 borderline samples 的 probability assignment 不够 extreme\n      （predicts 0.85 instead of 0.99 for clear pass cases）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-model calibration for exception_only\"\n        data:\n          - {model: \"Qwen-7B\", accuracy: \"99.83%\", ece: 0.0027, brier: 0.0013, calibration_quality: \"Near-perfect\"}\n          - {model: \"Qwen-1.5B\", accuracy: \"99.83%\", ece: 0.0041, brier: 0.0019, calibration_quality: \"Excellent\"}\n          - {model: \"DeepSeek\", accuracy: \"99.33%\", ece: 0.0523, brier: 0.0318, calibration_quality: \"Moderate\"}\n          - {model: \"CodeLlama\", accuracy: \"99.83%\", ece: 0.0183, brier: 0.0072, calibration_quality: \"Good\"}\n      - name: \"Calibration gap: exception_only vs no_trace (cross-model)\"\n        data:\n          - {model: \"Qwen-7B\", exc_ece: 0.0027, no_trace_ece: 0.1715, ratio: \"63x\"}\n          - {model: \"Qwen-1.5B\", exc_ece: 0.0041, no_trace_ece: \"~0.21\", ratio: \"~51x\"}\n          - {model: \"DeepSeek\", exc_ece: 0.0523, no_trace_ece: \"~0.18\", ratio: \"~3.4x\"}\n          - {model: \"CodeLlama\", exc_ece: 0.0183, no_trace_ece: \"~0.17\", ratio: \"~9.3x\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Reliability diagram grid (2×2): 4 models, exception_only condition。Qwen 两模型几乎完美对角线，CodeLlama 略有偏离，DeepSeek 在 low-confidence bins 有明显 miscalibration。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-model calibration 在 worst 档下呈现 model-dependency。Qwen family\n      (7B + 1.5B) 近完美，但 DeepSeek ECE 比 Qwen 高 ~19x（0.0523 vs 0.0027），\n      CodeLlama 高 ~7x。这使 \"calibration as secondary evidence\" 从 universal\n      finding 降级为 model-dependent finding。\n      \n      然而，calibration improvement ratio (exc vs no_trace) 在所有模型上都存在\n      （3.4x-63x），只是 magnitude model-dependent。论文可保留 \"exception signal\n      improves calibration\" claim 但需加 \"magnitude varies across models\" qualifier。\n      \n      DeepSeek 的 poor calibration (ECE=0.0523) 与其 accuracy (99.33%) 的 disconnect\n      呼应 D1 (eval_loss vs accuracy decoupling)——token-level confidence 与\n      sample-level correctness decoupled。审稿人可能质疑: 如果 calibration 是\n      model-dependent 的，那 calibration evidence 对 Claim 1 的 supporting 作用\n      大打折扣。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_020: Few-shot prompting baseline (GPT-4o / Claude)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"few_shot_frontier_baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020\"\n    description: \"GPT-4o / Claude 直接判断 pass/fail (0-shot + 3-shot)，与 SFT exception_only 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      gpt4o:\n        zero_shot_no_trace:\n          accuracy: 0.823\n          pass_f1: 0.876\n          fail_f1: 0.687\n        zero_shot_exception_only:\n          accuracy: 0.955\n          pass_f1: 0.970\n          fail_f1: 0.918\n        three_shot_exception_only:\n          accuracy: 0.972\n          pass_f1: 0.981\n          fail_f1: 0.950\n      claude_sonnet:\n        zero_shot_no_trace:\n          accuracy: 0.808\n          pass_f1: 0.862\n          fail_f1: 0.667\n        zero_shot_exception_only:\n          accuracy: 0.948\n          pass_f1: 0.965\n          fail_f1: 0.908\n        three_shot_exception_only:\n          accuracy: 0.965\n          pass_f1: 0.977\n          fail_f1: 0.934\n      sft_exception_only_qwen7b:\n        accuracy: 0.9983\n        pass_f1: 0.999\n        fail_f1: 0.997\n      gap_best_fewshot_vs_sft_pp: 2.63\n      gap_pvalue: 0.001\n      api_cost_per_1190_samples_gpt4o: \"$12-18\"\n      sft_inference_cost_per_1190: \"$0.02-0.05\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPT-4o 0-shot no_trace (82.3%): frontier model 可以从 code + test case\n      推断 correctness，但受限于 cannot actually execute code。类似我们的 no_trace\n      baseline (75.13%)，但 GPT-4o 的 code understanding 远强于 Qwen-7B base，\n      因此 +7pp。\n\n      GPT-4o 0-shot exception_only (95.5%): 给出 exception trace 后，GPT-4o 能\n      准确判断 \"[ERROR] TypeError\" → fail, \"[No exception]\" → pass。但 GPT-4o 在\n      borderline cases（如 GeneratorExit）的判断与 SFT 模型类似——看到 [ERROR] 就\n      倾向判 fail。同时 GPT-4o 对 exception_only format 未经微调，可能对某些\n      formatting 不够 sensitive，导致 ~4.5% error rate。\n\n      GPT-4o 3-shot exception_only (97.2%): 3 个 examples 帮助 GPT-4o 理解\n      exception_only format 的 exact semantics，减少 formatting-related errors。\n      但仍有 ~2.8% error rate——主要来自 (1) GeneratorExit-like ambiguity,\n      (2) multi-exception traces where GPT-4o must judge severity,\n      (3) occasional refusal to make binary judgment on ambiguous cases。\n\n      SFT gap (2.63pp): 虽小但 statistically significant (n=1190, p=0.001)。\n      然而审稿人会质疑: \"2.63pp 值得 SFT pipeline 的 engineering effort 吗?\"\n\n      Claude Sonnet 略低于 GPT-4o (~0.7pp)，因为 code-specific training data\n      量可能略少。\n\n      Worst 档影响: few-shot baseline 接近 SFT，削弱 \"SFT is necessary\" narrative。\n      但可以 reframe: (1) SFT 7B 的推理成本比 GPT-4o API 低 ~300x;\n      (2) SFT calibration (ECE=0.0027) 远优于 GPT-4o prompt-based output;\n      (3) SFT 可 offline deploy 无 API dependency;\n      (4) 核心 finding 仍然 valid: exception signal 是 key，无论 SFT 还是 few-shot。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"SFT vs Few-shot vs Zero-shot comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {method: \"SFT exception_only (Qwen-7B)\", accuracy: \"99.83%\", cost_per_1190: \"~$0.03\", latency_ms: \"~50\", calibration_ece: 0.0027}\n          - {method: \"GPT-4o 3-shot + exception\", accuracy: \"97.2%\", cost_per_1190: \"~$15\", latency_ms: \"~2000\", calibration_ece: \"N/A (no logits)\"}\n          - {method: \"GPT-4o 0-shot + exception\", accuracy: \"95.5%\", cost_per_1190: \"~$12\", latency_ms: \"~2000\", calibration_ece: \"N/A\"}\n          - {method: \"Claude 3-shot + exception\", accuracy: \"96.5%\", cost_per_1190: \"~$10\", latency_ms: \"~1800\", calibration_ece: \"N/A\"}\n          - {method: \"GPT-4o 0-shot no trace\", accuracy: \"82.3%\", cost_per_1190: \"~$8\", latency_ms: \"~1500\", calibration_ece: \"N/A\"}\n          - {method: \"SFT no_trace (Qwen-7B)\", accuracy: \"75.1%\", cost_per_1190: \"~$0.02\", latency_ms: \"~30\", calibration_ece: 0.1715}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: accuracy × method。SFT exception_only 最高但与 GPT-4o 3-shot 的 gap 视觉上不大。需要 inset 或 zoomed panel 展示 97-100% 区间的差异。附加 cost annotation 展示 300x cost saving。\"\n    analysis: >\n      在 worst 档下，few-shot baseline 是论文最大的 narrative threat 之一。\n      GPT-4o 3-shot 97.2% vs SFT 99.83% 的 2.63pp gap 虽 significant，\n      但审稿人会提出两个攻击:\n      \n      (1) \"如果 GPT-4o 加更多 examples 或 chain-of-thought 就能追上 SFT？\"\n      → 无法反驳，因为我们没测。但 3-shot 已经 nearly saturated（0-shot 95.5%\n      → 3-shot 97.2%, diminishing returns），extrapolation 不太可能到 99.8%。\n      \n      (2) \"SFT 的 marginal 2.63pp 不值得 training pipeline 的复杂度\"\n      → 需用 cost argument (300x cheaper) + calibration argument (ECE=0.0027\n      vs GPT-4o no logits) + offline deployment 来反驳。\n      \n      Reframe: few-shot 结果实际上 STRENGTHENS \"exception signal is key\" claim\n      ——even frontier models benefit most from exception trace (+13pp for GPT-4o)。\n      SFT 的 advantage 是 practical (cost/calibration)，不是 signal discovery。\n      Signal discovery (exception > everything else) 是 universal finding，\n      无论 SFT 还是 prompting。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_021: OOD generalization\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"ood_generalization_test\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_021\"\n    description: \"在不同编程语言/项目的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\"\n    expected_results:\n      python_ood_dataset:\n        name: \"LeetCode-style problems (different distribution from HumanEval/MBPP)\"\n        exception_only: 0.871\n        vota: 0.793\n        no_trace: 0.682\n        exception_lift_over_notrace: 0.189\n      cross_language:\n        feasibility: \"NOT_FEASIBLE_WITHIN_TIMELINE\"\n        reason: \"需要新的 trace collection pipeline for Java/JS/C++; exception format 跨语言差异大\"\n      domain_shift_analysis:\n        in_distribution_exc_accuracy: 0.9983\n        ood_exc_accuracy: 0.871\n        degradation_pp: 12.7\n        relative_ordering_preserved: true\n        exception_still_best_on_ood: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Python OOD (LeetCode-style): 训练数据来自 HumanEval + MBPP-sanitized (591\n      problems)，这些是 relatively simple、well-defined 的编程题。LeetCode-style\n      problems 更复杂（涉及 DP, graph algorithms, complex data structures），\n      exception patterns 可能包含 training 未见过的 error types (e.g., RecursionError,\n      MemoryError, complex nested exceptions)。\n\n      exception_only 87.1%: 下降 12.7pp 因为 (1) unseen exception types —— 模型\n      对 RecursionError 等 training 中罕见的 exception 缺乏 calibrated 判断;\n      (2) OOD problems 的 pass/fail 比例可能不同 (training = 71.5% pass);\n      (3) LeetCode problems 可能有 time limit exceeded 等 non-exception failures\n      ——代码不抛异常但 output 错误——exception_only 表征中这些显示为 \"[No exception]\"\n      但 label=fail，模型在 OOD 上对这类 pattern 的 confusion 更大。\n\n      VOTA 79.3%: 更大的 degradation (20.1pp) 因为 VOTA 的 loop compression\n      和 ae extraction 对 LeetCode trace 结构的 assumption 不 match——\n      complex data structures 的 trace 不 follow 简单的 loop iteration pattern。\n\n      no_trace 68.2%: 下降 7pp，说明 LeetCode problems 本身 harder（更难从\n      code alone 判断 correctness），但 degradation 较小因为 no_trace 的 ceiling\n      本来就低。\n\n      Relative ordering preserved (exception > VOTA > no_trace) 是正面信号——\n      说明 exception dominance 的 conclusion generalizes even if absolute\n      numbers drop。但 12.7pp degradation 被审稿人 ammunition: \"model overfits\n      to HumanEval/MBPP exception distribution\"。\n\n      Cross-language (Java/JS/C++): 在 deadline 前 NOT FEASIBLE。需要:\n      (1) trace collection infrastructure per language (Java Jacoco/bytecode,\n      JS Istanbul, C++ sanitizers); (2) exception format normalization\n      (Java stack traces ≠ Python tracebacks); (3) test suite per language。\n      估计 3-4 weeks 工作量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"OOD generalization results\"\n        data:\n          - {condition: \"exception_only\", in_dist: \"99.83%\", ood_python: \"87.1%\", delta: \"-12.7pp\"}\n          - {condition: \"VOTA\", in_dist: \"99.41%\", ood_python: \"79.3%\", delta: \"-20.1pp\"}\n          - {condition: \"no_trace\", in_dist: \"75.13%\", ood_python: \"68.2%\", delta: \"-6.9pp\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: in-distribution vs OOD for 3 conditions。所有条件都有 degradation 但 relative ordering preserved。exception_only 的 degradation (-12.7pp) 居中——比 VOTA (-20.1pp) 小但比 no_trace (-6.9pp) 大。\"\n    analysis: >\n      OOD 泛化性在 worst 档下是 mixed 结果。正面: relative ordering preserved,\n      exception_only 仍为最佳。负面: 12.7pp degradation 说明 exception_only 的\n      near-perfect in-distribution accuracy 部分依赖于 HumanEval/MBPP 的 exception\n      pattern 分布（dominated by TypeError, ValueError, AssertionError），\n      对 unseen exception types 的 generalization 有限。\n\n      对论文的影响: OOD 结果不应放入 main paper（太弱），只在 Discussion 提\n      generalization limitation + future work。跨语言完全不可行，成为 explicit\n      limitation。审稿人关于 \"single task, single dataset\" 的 concern 在 OOD\n      数据上部分证实——exception signal 的 universality 限于 similar exception\n      distributions。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_022: Training dynamics\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"training_dynamics_comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_022\"\n    description: \"exception_only vs full_trace 的 learning curve (每 50 steps eval)\"\n    expected_results:\n      exception_only_curve:\n        step_0: 0.50\n        step_50: 0.962\n        step_100: 0.991\n        step_150: 0.995\n        step_200: 0.998\n        step_250: 0.998\n        convergence_step: 100\n      full_trace_curve:\n        step_0: 0.50\n        step_50: 0.721\n        step_100: 0.768\n        step_150: 0.803\n        step_200: 0.812\n        step_250: 0.818\n        convergence_step: 200\n      speed_ratio: 2.0  # exception_only converges ~2x faster in steps\n      exception_step50_vs_full_converged: \"+14.4pp\"\n      curve_noise:\n        exception_only_step_std: 0.003\n        full_trace_step_std: 0.018\n    result_rationale: >\n      exception_only: signal 结构简单（[ERROR] type: ... 或 [No exception]），\n      模型在 ~50 steps 即能学到 binary mapping（有 exception → fail, 无 → pass），\n      此后 refinement 主要是 calibration improvement 和 edge cases。Step 50\n      的 96.2% 已经超过 full_trace 的最终 converged accuracy (81.8%)。\n      这支持 information density 假说——exception signal 的 signal-to-noise ratio\n      极高，学习效率自然高。\n\n      full_trace: 模型需要从 long, noisy traces 中学到什么是 relevant，\n      这本身就是一个 learning problem。Step 50 时模型刚开始区分 trace structure\n      (72.1%≈no_trace baseline + few pp)，到 step 200 才稳定在 ~82%。\n      Step-to-step variance (std=0.018 per step) 比 exception_only (0.003) 高 6x，\n      说明 full_trace 的 optimization landscape 更 noisy。\n\n      Speed ratio 2x: exception_only 在 ~100 steps converge，full_trace 在 ~200\n      steps。ratio 只有 2x（不是 10x）因为两者都使用相同的 LoRA rank 和 learning\n      rate——exception_only 的主要优势是 ceiling height (99.83% vs 81.8%)，不是\n      convergence speed 本身。\n\n      Worst 档 caveat: curves are noisy（尤其 full_trace），step-to-step\n      fluctuations 使 figure 不够 clean for publication。exception_only curve\n      在 step 50 之后几乎 flat（从 96.2% → 99.8%，3.6pp over 200 steps），\n      作为 learning curve figure 不 visually interesting。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Learning curve milestones\"\n        data:\n          - {condition: \"exception_only\", step_50: \"96.2%\", step_100: \"99.1%\", step_200: \"99.8%\", final: \"99.83%\", converge_step: 100}\n          - {condition: \"full_trace\", step_50: \"72.1%\", step_100: \"76.8%\", step_200: \"81.2%\", final: \"81.8%\", converge_step: 200}\n          - {condition: \"no_trace\", step_50: \"71.5%\", step_100: \"73.8%\", step_200: \"75.0%\", final: \"75.1%\", converge_step: 150}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve plot (accuracy vs training steps): 3 条线 + shaded CI bands。exception_only 在 step 50 处几乎 vertical rise 后 flat；full_trace 缓慢爬升但 noisy（visible step-to-step jitter）；no_trace 几乎 flat 从 start。X-axis 需要 log scale 或 zoom panel 来展示 exception_only 的 early rise。Overall: informative but not publication-quality due to noise and the exception_only curve being essentially a step function。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Training dynamics 在 worst 档下提供 supporting evidence 但不够强作为\n      独立 contribution。核心 finding (exception_only 收敛更快) 是 expected\n      且 trivial——simpler signal naturally easier to learn。2x speed ratio\n      不够 dramatic（如果是 10x 则更有 narrative value）。\n\n      对论文的影响: 可在 Appendix 放 learning curve figure 作为 supplementary\n      evidence for Claim 2 (information density)。但不应作为 main result——\n      审稿人会说 \"of course simpler signals converge faster, this is not\n      a contribution\"。\n\n      唯一 novel 的 data point: exception_only step 50 (96.2%) > full_trace\n      final (81.8%)。这意味着 exception_only 在仅 1/6 的训练时间内就超越了\n      full_trace 的 theoretical ceiling。可以用一句话在 Results 中提及，\n      但不值得 dedicated subsection。\n```\n\n**总结**: worst 档下 7 个 planned 实验中，budget curve 相关的 plan_016 和 plan_017 产出最差——4 模型模式完全分裂，CodeLlama W-shape 不可解释，seed robustness 也 model-dependent。plan_018-022 提供 supplementary value 但无独立 contribution。论文唯一可靠的 anchor 仍是 exception_only 的 cross-model dominance (99.83% × 4 models on best seeds)。Budget curve 整体移入 Appendix，reframe 为 \"why exception_only is preferable to length-dependent approaches\" 的反面教材。","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"2ab8c5fb-4182-4e41-aa76-fa6d46b502a0","total_cost_usd":0.9754499999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41698,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":26887,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41698,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":26887,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41698,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41698},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":36652,"outputTokens":16,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.036731999999999994,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":26887,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":41698,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.9387179999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"c2b465be-598b-406d-ba85-dfcc5a96b261"}
